### Cake Platform API - Public Customer Storefront Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/storefront/shops
# Replace with the shop ID you want to test against (must be ACTIVE)
@shopId = 4

### =========================================
### 1. View Public Shop Profile
### =========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{shopId}}

### =========================================
### 1.5. Search Nearby Shops (Location based)
### =========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?location=Akurdi

### =========================================
### 2. View Active Products
### =========================================
# @name getProducts
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{shopId}}/products

### =========================================
### 3. Place a Guest Order
### =========================================
# @name placeGuestOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{shopId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "Alice Smith",
    "customerEmail": "alice@example.com",
    "customerPhone": "+1234567890",
    "paymentMethod": "COD",
    "deliveryAddress": "123 Customer Lane, City",
    "deliveryDate": "2026-10-15",
    "deliverySlotId": 1,
    "couponCode": "WELCOME20",
    "items": [
        {
            "productId": 13,
            "variantId": 1,
            "quantity": 5,
            "dietaryPreference": "EGGLESS",
            "cakeMessage": "Happy Birthday Alice!",
            "addonIds": [1]
        }
    ]
}

### Store the generated orderNumber
@orderNumber = {{placeGuestOrder.response.body.orderNumber}}

### =========================================
### 4. Download Invoice (Customer)
### =========================================
GET http://localhost:8080/api/storefront/shops/orders/{{orderNumber}}/invoice
